# Virtual providers, pinned here for the same reason as the desktop profiles:
# only a package named on the pacstrap command line settles provider
# selection, and --noconfirm does not answer provider prompts.
#
# iptables   provides libxtables.so, wanted by iproute2, which `base` needs.
# exim       provides smtp-forwarder, wanted by arpwatch (shani-tools-network).
# No oci-runtime pin: this profile has no podman or buildah, so nothing asks.
# cronie is already listed above, so the `cron` virtual is unambiguous here.
iptables
exim
